# Chrome extension

## Boundaries

- Service worker orchestrates listeners, alarms, notifications, and messaging
- Pure detection / insight math stays in `@/lib` (import thresholds from `@/constants`)
- Prefer `@/chrome/*` helpers over scattering raw `chrome.*` calls

## Patterns

```ts
// ❌ BAD — detection + Chrome API mixed in the worker
chrome.tabs.onActivated.addListener((info) => {
  if (recentSwitches.length >= 5) chrome.notifications.create(/* ... */);
});

// ✅ GOOD — worker orchestrates; lib decides
import { shouldTriggerRapidSwitchAlert } from '@/lib/detection';
import { storageGet } from '@/chrome/storage';
```

## Constraints

- Manifest V3: no persistent background page; handle ephemeral worker lifetime
- Least privilege: do not register the content script until in-page UI is required
- Persist via `chrome.storage.local` only (MVP)
- Use `MESSAGE_TYPES` from `@/constants` for runtime messages
